      "path": "/books/al-kafi:8:1:37:15",
      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ (عليه السلام) يَقُولُ آخَى رَسُولُ اللَّهِ (صلى الله عليه وآله) بَيْنَ سَلْمَانَ وَ أَبِي ذَرٍّ وَ اشْتَرَطَ عَلَى أَبِي ذَرٍّ أَنْ لَا يَعْصِيَ سَلْمَانَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473290\">H 14616</a> – Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Mansour Bin Al-Abbas, from Suleyman Al-Musattaq, from Saleh Al-Howl who said:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-i\">I</span> heard Abu Abdullah</span><sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘The Rasool<sup>saww</sup> established brotherhood between Salman<sup>ar</sup> and Abu Dharr<sup>ar</sup>, and stipulated a condition upon Abu Dharr<sup>ar</sup> that he<sup>ar</sup> would not disobey Salman<sup>ar</sup> (as a younger to an elder brother)."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "168. Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Mansour Bin Al-Abbas, from Suleyman Al-Musattaq, from Saleh Al-Howl who said: I heard Abu Abdullah (a.s.) saying: ‘The Rasool (saww) established brotherhood between Salman (ar) and Abu Dharr (ar), and stipulated a condition upon Abu Dharr (ar) that he (ar) would not disobey Salman (ar) (as a younger to an elder brother)."
        ]
      }
